' ==================== NOTES ====================

note top of Cart
  **Guest vs Logged Cart:**
  - user_id NULL = Guest cart (session-based)
  - user_id SET = Logged user cart (persistent)
  - cart_token for guest identification
  - Auto-migration on login/register
end note

note top of Order
  **Order Immutability:**
  - Product snapshot in order_items
  - Addresses copied, not referenced
  - Historical data preserved
  - Status tracked in history table
end note

note top of Payment
  **Gateway Integration:**
  - Uses PaymentAdapterInterface
  - Supports multiple gateways
  - Webhook signature verification
  - Transaction logging
end note

note bottom of PaymentAdapterInterface
  **Adapter Pattern:**
  Developers implement this interface
  to integrate payment gateways:
  - StripeAdapter
  - PayPalAdapter
  - RazorpayAdapter
  - Custom adapters
end note

note right of CartService
  **Integration Points:**
  - ProductService (validate products)
  - StockService (check availability)
  - Event system (cart changes)
  - ResponseProtocol (API responses)
end note

note right of OrderService
  **Stock Management:**
  - Lock stock on order creation
  - Release on cancellation
  - Integration with StockService
  - Transaction-based operations
end note

